      "npc" : "Affable Lady",
      "text" : "[Affable Lady]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Affable Lady",
      "text" : "People often let their preconceived notions fool them. Most people don't think an old woman like me would sell such special items."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
